{'symbol': 'CMS', 'date': '2022-06-23 15:15:00', 'title': 'LANDMARK PLAN TO ACCELERATE END OF COAL ERA, PROVIDE RELIABILITY AND PROTECT ENVIRONMENT EARNS APPROVAL', 'text': 'JACKSON, MICH. , JUNE 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- A KEY REGULATORY DECISION TODAY CLEARED THE WAY FOR CONSUMERS ENERGY TO STOP BURNING COAL TO GENERATE ELECTRICITY BY 2025 — 15 YEARS FASTER THAN PREVIOUSLY PLANNED — AND PROVIDE RELIABLE ELECTRICITY FOR MICHIGAN.'}